(7566705, 1212281, 30364, '<td valign="top">Holy Smoke Mariuca, ... this photograph is one of the greats here.  What a deeply enchanting thing it is; some Hopper, some Brancoveanu, some fairy dust.  It''s beautiful.  You have done many thrilling things here, I could cite a dozen or more, but this one is more still.  Thank you.<br/> <br/>Edit, typo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-04-21 08:47:27.</i></td>', 'Holy Smoke Mariuca, ... this photograph is one of the greats here.  What a deeply enchanting thing it is; some Hopper, some Brancoveanu, some fairy dust.  It''s beautiful.  You have done many thrilling things here, I could cite a dozen or more, but this one is more still.  Thank you. Edit, typo.', '2018-04-21 09:37:06.000000', '2018-04-21 09:47:27.000000', 0);
